  "description": "Can you explain the history of the world?\n\n“You learned it at school.”\n“You kind of remember it.”\nBut even the history we think we know can be surprisingly vague,\nand we may struggle to explain how events are connected.\n\nThis game is a world history knowledge quiz\ncovering history from ancient times to the modern era.\n\nFamous events, historical figures, civilizations, and the flow of history.\nBased on world history,\nyou’ll face quiz questions about historical knowledge you think you know.\n\nHow to play is simple.\n・Read the question  \n・Choose an answer by intuition  \n・Understand instantly with results and explanations  \n\nEven when you answer correctly, there’s still something to learn.\nEven when you get it wrong, you’ll think, “Ah, I see.”\n\nPlay from just one question at a time.\nPerfect for passing time or refreshing your historical knowledge.\n\nHow much of your world history knowledge still holds up today?\nWhy not put it to the test?\n\nThe game supports both button controls and touch controls, allowing you to play in TV mode, handheld mode, or tabletop mode.\n※This game is designed to be played on the Nintendo Switch™ in vertical orientation.",
